      "cooked": "<p>This came up in our last game.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Omnitron has 3 components that say \"Destroy this card when Omnitron is dealt 7 or more damage in one round\".</p><p>They are, Electro-Magnetic Railgun, Disintegration Ray and Interpolation Beam.</p><p>Here's the question. &nbsp;If 7 damage is dealt to Omnitron in 1 round, and 3 of these cards are in play, would all of them be destroyed?</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
